OL,3,GNEWSAMan agreed drugging and raping
OL,4,Awife was 'risky as hell', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA man who drugged and raped his wife
OL,10,Ffor more than 20 years agreed it was
OL,11,F"risky as hell, but the thought of it
OL,12,Fis so hot", a jury has heard.
OL,14,FThe victim's husband, who cannot be
OL,15,Fidentified to protect his wife's
OL,16,Fanonymity, pleaded guilty in September
OL,17,Fto offences dating from 2004 -
OL,18,Fincluding rape, sexual assault and
OL,19,Fadministering a substance with intent
OL,20,Fto commit a sexual offence.
